## 📁 Organized Project Structure
```
01_PRIMARY_SYSTEM/           # Enhanced training and recognition systems
├── gpu_optimized_training.py      # 🚀 GPU training (10x faster)
├── hybrid_cpu_gpu_training.py     # ⚡ Hybrid CPU+GPU training
├── hand_focused_CNN_LSTM.py       # 💻 CPU training (universal)
├── gpu_optimized_camera.py        # 🎥 GPU camera (25+ FPS)
├── enhanced_camera.py             # 📹 Standard camera (2-5 FPS)
├── hand_tracking_demo.py          # 📽️ Video analysis tool
└── hand_detection.py              # 🖐️ Core hand detection

02_FALLBACK_COMPATIBILITY/  # Legacy system compatibility
03_DATA_CONFIG/             # Dataset configurations and class names
04_DOCUMENTATION/           # Complete documentation and guides
05_OUTPUT_GENERATED/        # Training outputs, models, and results

simple_gpu_benchmark.py     # 📊 Performance benchmark tool
main.py                     # 🚀 Interactive launcher (START HERE)
```

