## 📊 Performance Comparison

| Training Method | Time | GPU Memory | Real-time FPS | Best For |
|----------------|------|------------|---------------|----------|
| 🚀 **GPU Training** | 1-2 hours | 0.6GB | 25+ FPS | NVIDIA GPU users |
| ⚡ **Hybrid Training** | 3-6 hours | 0.4GB | 15+ FPS | Balanced systems |
| 💻 **CPU Training** | 8-15 hours | N/A | 2-5 FPS | Universal compatibility |

### GPU vs CPU Benchmark Results (Example: GTX 1650)
- **GPU Speedup**: 10.9x faster than CPU training
- **Training Time**: 1-2 hours vs 10+ hours  
- **Real-time Recognition**: 25+ FPS vs 2-5 FPS
- **Memory Usage**: 0.6GB GPU memory vs 2GB+ RAM

