## 🏗️ Model Architecture

### GPU-Optimized Hand-Focused CNN-LSTM **ENHANCED**
- **CNN Backbone**: Pre-trained ResNet18 with fine-tuning
- **Temporal Layer**: Bidirectional LSTM with 2 layers
- **Attention**: Multi-head attention mechanism (8 heads)
- **Input**: Hand-extracted regions (224x224)
- **Training**: GPU-optimized with mixed precision
- **Features**: Enhanced dropout, weight decay, and GPU-specific optimizations

### Hybrid CPU+GPU Architecture
- **Data Processing**: CPU handles video loading and hand detection
- **Model Training**: GPU accelerates neural network computations
- **Memory Management**: Smart distribution between CPU RAM and GPU VRAM

### Standard Hand-Focused CNN-LSTM
- **CNN Backbone**: Pre-trained ResNet18 (frozen)
- **Temporal Layer**: Bidirectional LSTM with 2 layers
- **Attention**: Multi-head attention mechanism (8 heads)
- **Input**: Hand-extracted regions (224x224)
- **Training**: CPU-based with hand-specific augmentation strategies

