## 🚀 Quick Start Guide

### 1. **First Time Setup**
```bash
# Install dependencies (choose based on your system)

# Standard installation (CPU only)
pip install torch torchvision opencv-python pillow numpy scikit-learn mediapipe

# GPU installation (NVIDIA users - RECOMMENDED)
pip install torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu121
pip install opencv-python pillow numpy scikit-learn mediapipe
```

### 2. **Launch Interactive System**
```bash
python main.py
```

### 3. **Follow the Guided Workflow**
1. **Run Benchmark** (Option 1) - Get personalized recommendations
2. **Train Model** (Option 2) - Choose based on benchmark results
3. **Test Recognition** (Option 3) - Try real-time recognition
4. **Analyze Videos** (Option 4) - Process existing videos

### 4. **Manual Commands (Advanced Users)**
```bash
# GPU Training (fastest)
python 01_PRIMARY_SYSTEM/gpu_optimized_training.py

# Hybrid Training (balanced) 
python 01_PRIMARY_SYSTEM/hybrid_cpu_gpu_training.py

# CPU Training (universal)
python 01_PRIMARY_SYSTEM/hand_focused_CNN_LSTM.py

# GPU Camera (fastest recognition)
python 01_PRIMARY_SYSTEM/gpu_optimized_camera.py

# Standard Camera
python 01_PRIMARY_SYSTEM/enhanced_camera.py

# Benchmark your system
python simple_gpu_benchmark.py
```

