## ⚙️ Advanced Configuration

### Custom Hand Detection Settings
Modify parameters in `hand_detection.py`:
```python
hand_detector = HandDetector(
    static_image_mode=False,            # False for video, True for images
    max_num_hands=2,                    # Detect up to 2 hands
    min_detection_confidence=0.7,       # Higher = more strict detection
    min_tracking_confidence=0.5         # Tracking stability threshold
)
```

### Training Customization
In training scripts, adjust:
```python
# GPU Training (gpu_optimized_training.py)
batch_size = get_optimal_batch_size(device)  # Auto-optimized
num_epochs = 15                              # Training duration
USE_MIXED_PRECISION = True                   # GPU memory optimization

# CPU Training (hand_focused_CNN_LSTM.py)  
batch_size = 2                              # Reduce if memory issues
ENABLE_VALIDATION = True                    # Enable validation split
augment_factor = 10                         # Data augmentation multiplier
```

### Camera Performance Tuning
```python
# In camera scripts, adjust:
cap.set(cv2.CAP_PROP_FRAME_WIDTH, 1280)    # Higher = better quality
cap.set(cv2.CAP_PROP_FRAME_HEIGHT, 720)    # Higher = more processing
cap.set(cv2.CAP_PROP_FPS, 30)              # Camera frame rate

# Recognition settings
buffer_size = 16                            # Frames for prediction
confidence_threshold = 0.7                  # Prediction confidence
```

