## 📈 Performance Optimization Tips

### 🚀 **For Maximum Speed (GPU Users)**
1. Use GPU Training (Option 2 → 1) - 10x faster
2. Use GPU Camera (Option 3 → 2) - 25+ FPS
3. Run benchmark first to optimize settings
4. Close other GPU applications during training

### ⚖️ **For Balanced Performance**
1. Use Hybrid Training (Option 2 → 3) - 3-6 hours
2. Standard camera works well for most use cases
3. Good for systems with moderate GPU performance

### 💻 **For Universal Compatibility**
1. Use CPU Training (Option 2 → 2) - Works everywhere
2. Standard Camera (Option 3 → 1) - 2-5 FPS
3. No GPU requirements
4. Perfect for deployment on any system

